#
# Every tool the gate installs into its environments, one exact pin each; the
# library itself has no runtime dependency. dev.txt is the lock compiled from
# this file: all packages with hashes. Change a pin here, then regenerate the
# lock with `make lock`, which runs the command recorded in the dev.txt
# header. A pin is at least three days old when it is adopted; `make lock`
# enforces that with --exclude-newer.
#
# The licence check (reuse) is not here: its only wheel is built for one
# interpreter version, and installing its source distribution would run a
# build outside this lock. The Makefile takes it from PATH (REUSE).
